+  <!-- Contents:
+
+       This file interprets Chicago using APA's four basic reference elements
+       (cf. CMOS18 14.2, 14.64, 14.161):
+
+        1. Author (CMOS18 13.74-86)
+        2. Date (author-date system only, CMOS18 13.102)
